    "tactics": "",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Splash [Combat]: Ranged attack (Dex 3 + Ranged Combat 1), Range: 10 ft.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 4 damage (1 + 3 Dex); target gains Dazzled condition until end of their next turn.</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 4 damage, DR halved (round up) + 2 cold damage; target makes Reflex save (1 success) or drops a loosely held item from the wet grip.</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Aqueous Form: Fits through any gap water can pass through. An undisturbed Droplet in clear water requires a Hard task Perception [hard] check to notice by sight. Contaminate: Over 1 minute of contact, makes a body of liquid foul-tasting, cloudy, or cold. Not harmful but detectable with a Perception/Medicine [Easy] check.</p>",
